  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The 33-step method explains the attempt to reconcile one of humankind's most ancient dreams: the dream of flying without the aid of mechanical devices...The notes for "Flying" were mostly written between 1997 and 2000, when the initial structure of the method was laid out in its most basic and effective format.  A good portion of these writings are purely technical notes that trace the development and separate elements of the project." -- p.[2]</subfield>
